  "requiredBehavior": [
    "QD009: Only a newly retained equipment ROUTE_UNAVAILABLE primary removes absent exact current-equipment-namespace hazard IDs. Present inactive equipment and unrelated hazard IDs remain; both production callers supply the current snapshot.",
    "QD009: Preserve stationary unresolved action, reason, priority, assistance, empty route and destination, current profile/locale binding, immutable first guidance, cumulative history, help request and incident lifecycle; sensor/position/fire/gas/combined cause sets are unchanged.",
    "QD010: Maeda has five physical pentagonal hollow principal shells, one fixed and four moving. Four quarter-share stages use the approved variable-length articulation array; other equipment entries and assets remain unchanged.",
    "QD010: Preserve declared origin, units, baseline 10m, 8–10.6m length and 30–75deg boom ranges, 1–4.5m hook range, and endpoint/hook law. Physical topology/profile and authored reconstruction provenance change.",
    "The matching global MC305C-5 brochure supports five-section pentagonal construction. CE dimensions are separately sourced; individual section dimensions, angles, walls and demo limits remain authored reconstruction values."
  ],
